      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "The page is one plain HTML and CSS file with no framework and no server, as in R1 to R4. It has no entity design. It has these sections in order: hero with a call-to-action that scrolls to the form, featured models, key features, testimonials, the lead request form, and contact. Validation and confirmation are client-side only, and the page makes no network call. The responsive layout has no horizontal scroll from 320 px to 1920 px."
